{"seq":3,"slug":"vue2-to-vue3-migration","title":"Vue 2 到 Vue 3 迁移","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/vue-in-depth/ecosystem-and-patterns/vue2-to-vue3-migration","wordCount":749,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"vue-2-到-vue-3-迁移\">Vue 2 到 Vue 3 迁移</h1><h2 id=\"迁移概述\">迁移概述</h2><p>Vue 3 引入了大量改进，同时也有若干破坏性变更。迁移不必一步到位，Vue 团队提供了兼容构建（Migration Build）支持渐进式升级。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    V2[&quot;Vue 2 项目&quot;]&#10;    V2 --&gt; MB[&quot;Migration Build&lt;br/&gt;(兼容模式)&quot;]&#10;    MB --&gt; Fix[&quot;逐步修复警告&quot;]&#10;    Fix --&gt; V3[&quot;Vue 3 项目&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    V2[\"Vue 2 项目\"]\n    V2 --&gt; MB[\"Migration Build&lt;br/&gt;(兼容模式)\"]\n    MB --&gt; Fix[\"逐步修复警告\"]\n    Fix --&gt; V3[\"Vue 3 项目\"]</pre><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>破坏性变更</strong>：Vue 3 无法向下兼容的改动，集中在全局 API 实例化方式、v-model 行为与被移除的特性上。</li>\n<li><strong>Migration Build</strong>：<code>@vue/compat</code> 提供的兼容构建，让 Vue 2 代码在 Vue 3 运行时下工作并输出迁移警告。</li>\n<li><strong>兼容模式分级</strong>：<code>MODE: 2</code> 保留旧行为、<code>MODE: 3</code> 恢复新行为，逐项关闭兼容开关即为迁移进度。</li>\n<li><strong>渐进式迁移</strong>：环境升级 → 核心 API 迁移 → 现代化改造，分三阶段降低一次性改造风险。</li>\n<li><strong>生态兼容性</strong>：第三方库的 Vue 3 版本可用性是迁移排期的关键前提。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"主要破坏性变更\">主要破坏性变更</h2><h3 id=\"全局-api-变化\">全局 API 变化</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Vue 2</th>\n<th>Vue 3</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>new Vue()</code></td>\n<td><code>createApp()</code></td>\n<td>应用实例化方式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Vue.component()</code></td>\n<td><code>app.component()</code></td>\n<td>全局组件注册</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Vue.directive()</code></td>\n<td><code>app.directive()</code></td>\n<td>全局指令注册</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Vue.mixin()</code></td>\n<td><code>app.mixin()</code></td>\n<td>全局 mixin（不推荐）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Vue.use()</code></td>\n<td><code>app.use()</code></td>\n<td>插件安装</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Vue.prototype</code></td>\n<td><code>app.config.globalProperties</code></td>\n<td>全局属性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// Vue 2&#10;import Vue from &#39;vue&#39;;&#10;Vue.component(&#39;MyComponent&#39;, MyComponent);&#10;Vue.prototype.$http = axios;&#10;new Vue({ render: (h) =&gt; h(App) }).$mount(&#39;#app&#39;);&#10;&#10;// Vue 3&#10;import { createApp } from &#39;vue&#39;;&#10;const app = createApp(App);&#10;app.component(&#39;MyComponent&#39;, MyComponent);&#10;app.config.globalProperties.$http = axios;&#10;app.mount(&#39;#app&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Vue 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Vue </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'vue'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Vue.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">component</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'MyComponent'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, MyComponent);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Vue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">prototype</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.$http </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> axios;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Vue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">render</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">h</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> h</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(App) }).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">$mount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'#app'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Vue 3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { createApp } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'vue'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> app</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createApp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(App);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">app.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">component</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'MyComponent'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, MyComponent);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">app.config.globalProperties.$http </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> axios;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">app.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'#app'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"模板语法变化\">模板语法变化</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- Vue 2: v-model 使用 value + input --&gt;&#10;&lt;CustomInput v-model=&quot;text&quot; /&gt;&#10;&lt;!-- 等价于 --&gt;&#10;&lt;CustomInput :value=&quot;text&quot; @input=&quot;text = $event&quot; /&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;!-- Vue 3: v-model 使用 modelValue + update:modelValue --&gt;&#10;&lt;CustomInput v-model=&quot;text&quot; /&gt;&#10;&lt;!-- 等价于 --&gt;&#10;&lt;CustomInput :model-value=&quot;text&quot; @update:model-value=&quot;text = $event&quot; /&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;!-- Vue 2: v-model 使用 value + input --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;CustomInput v-model=\"text\" /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;!-- 等价于 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;CustomInput :value=\"text\" @input=\"text = $event\" /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;!-- Vue 3: v-model 使用 modelValue + update:modelValue --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;CustomInput v-model=\"text\" /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;!-- 等价于 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;CustomInput :model-value=\"text\" @update:model-value=\"text = $event\" /></span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>变更</th>\n<th>Vue 2</th>\n<th>Vue 3</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>v-model prop</td>\n<td><code>value</code></td>\n<td><code>modelValue</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>v-model event</td>\n<td><code>input</code></td>\n<td><code>update:modelValue</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>.sync</code> 修饰符</td>\n<td><code>:title.sync=&quot;title&quot;</code></td>\n<td><code>v-model:title=&quot;title&quot;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多个 v-model</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>v-if</code> vs <code>v-for</code> 优先级</td>\n<td><code>v-for</code> 优先</td>\n<td><code>v-if</code> 优先</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>$listeners</code></td>\n<td>独立对象</td>\n<td>合并到 <code>$attrs</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过滤器 <code>|</code></td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>移除（使用 computed）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"移除的特性\">移除的特性</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>移除的特性</th>\n<th>替代方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>$on</code> / <code>$off</code> / <code>$once</code></td>\n<td>使用 mitt 等事件库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过滤器（Filters）</td>\n<td>使用 computed 或方法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>$children</code></td>\n<td>使用 <code>ref</code> + <code>expose</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>$listeners</code></td>\n<td>合并到 <code>$attrs</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>functional</code> 模板选项</td>\n<td>使用普通函数组件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>inline-template</code></td>\n<td>使用 <code>&lt;slot&gt;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>$destroy</code></td>\n<td>不再需要手动销毁</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// Vue 2: EventBus&#10;const bus = new Vue();&#10;bus.$on(&#39;event&#39;, handler);&#10;bus.$emit(&#39;event&#39;, data);&#10;&#10;// Vue 3: 使用 mitt&#10;import mitt from &#39;mitt&#39;;&#10;const emitter = mitt();&#10;emitter.on(&#39;event&#39;, handler);&#10;emitter.emit(&#39;event&#39;, data);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Vue 2: EventBus</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> bus</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Vue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">bus.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">$on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'event'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, handler);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">bus.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">$emit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'event'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, data);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Vue 3: 使用 mitt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mitt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'mitt'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> emitter</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> mitt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">emitter.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'event'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, handler);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">emitter.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">emit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'event'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, data);</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"migration-build\">Migration Build</h2><p>Vue 3 提供了兼容构建，允许在 Vue 3 环境中运行 Vue 2 代码：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// vue.config.js (Vue CLI) 或 vite.config.ts&#10;export default {&#10;  resolve: {&#10;    alias: {&#10;      vue: &#39;@vue/compat&#39;,&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// vue.config.js (Vue CLI) 或 vite.config.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  resolve: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    alias: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      vue: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'@vue/compat'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// main.ts — 兼容模式配置&#10;import { createApp, configureCompat } from &#39;vue&#39;;&#10;&#10;configureCompat({&#10;  MODE: 2,&#10;  GLOBAL_MOUNT: false,&#10;  INSTANCE_EVENT_EMITTER: false,&#10;  COMPONENT_V_MODEL: false,&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// main.ts — 兼容模式配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { createApp, configureCompat } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'vue'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">configureCompat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  MODE: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  GLOBAL_MOUNT: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  INSTANCE_EVENT_EMITTER: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  COMPONENT_V_MODEL: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p>兼容构建会在控制台输出迁移警告，帮助你逐个修复：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    Start[&quot;启用兼容模式 (MODE: 2)&quot;]&#10;    Start --&gt; Run[&quot;运行项目&quot;]&#10;    Run --&gt; Warn[&quot;查看控制台警告&quot;]&#10;    Warn --&gt; Fix[&quot;逐个修复警告&quot;]&#10;    Fix --&gt; Test[&quot;测试功能正常&quot;]&#10;    Test --&gt; Check{&quot;还有警告?&quot;}&#10;    Check -- 是 --&gt; Fix&#10;    Check -- 否 --&gt; Switch[&quot;切换到 MODE: 3&quot;]&#10;    Switch --&gt; Remove[&quot;移除 @vue/compat&quot;]&#10;    Remove --&gt; Done[&quot;迁移完成&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    Start[\"启用兼容模式 (MODE: 2)\"]\n    Start --&gt; Run[\"运行项目\"]\n    Run --&gt; Warn[\"查看控制台警告\"]\n    Warn --&gt; Fix[\"逐个修复警告\"]\n    Fix --&gt; Test[\"测试功能正常\"]\n    Test --&gt; Check{\"还有警告?\"}\n    Check -- 是 --&gt; Fix\n    Check -- 否 --&gt; Switch[\"切换到 MODE: 3\"]\n    Switch --&gt; Remove[\"移除 @vue/compat\"]\n    Remove --&gt; Done[\"迁移完成\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"渐进式迁移策略\">渐进式迁移策略</h2><h3 id=\"第一阶段-环境升级\">第一阶段：环境升级</h3><ol>\n<li>升级构建工具到支持 Vue 3 的版本</li>\n<li>安装 <code>@vue/compat</code> 替代 <code>vue</code></li>\n<li>配置兼容模式 <code>MODE: 2</code></li>\n<li>确保项目正常运行</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"第二阶段-核心迁移\">第二阶段：核心迁移</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 1. 替换全局 API&#10;// ❌ Vue 2&#10;import Vue from &#39;vue&#39;;&#10;new Vue({ render: (h) =&gt; h(App) }).$mount(&#39;#app&#39;);&#10;// ✅ Vue 3&#10;import { createApp } from &#39;vue&#39;;&#10;createApp(App).mount(&#39;#app&#39;);&#10;&#10;// 2. 替换 EventBus&#10;// ❌ Vue 2&#10;const bus = new Vue();&#10;// ✅ Vue 3&#10;import mitt from &#39;mitt&#39;;&#10;const bus = mitt();&#10;&#10;// 3. 更新 v-model&#10;// ❌ Vue 2 组件&#10;export default {&#10;  props: [&#39;value&#39;],&#10;  methods: {&#10;    update(val) {&#10;      this.$emit(&#39;input&#39;, val);&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;};&#10;// ✅ Vue 3 组件&#10;const model = defineModel&lt;string&gt;();\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 1. 替换全局 API</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ❌ Vue 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Vue </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'vue'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Vue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">render</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">h</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> h</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(App) }).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">$mount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'#app'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ✅ Vue 3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { createApp } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'vue'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createApp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(App).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'#app'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 2. 替换 EventBus</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ❌ Vue 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> bus</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Vue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ✅ Vue 3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mitt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'mitt'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> bus</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> mitt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 3. 更新 v-model</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ❌ Vue 2 组件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  props: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'value'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  methods: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    update</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">val</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">$emit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'input'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, val);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ✅ Vue 3 组件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> model</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> defineModel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>();</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"第三阶段-现代化\">第三阶段：现代化</h3><ol>\n<li>将 Options API 逐步迁移到 Composition API</li>\n<li>用 <code>&lt;script setup&gt;</code> 替换 <code>setup()</code> 函数</li>\n<li>将 Vuex 迁移到 Pinia</li>\n<li>切换到 <code>MODE: 3</code>，移除 <code>@vue/compat</code></li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"生态兼容性\">生态兼容性</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>库</th>\n<th>Vue 2 版本</th>\n<th>Vue 3 版本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Vue Router</td>\n<td>v3</td>\n<td>v4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Vuex</td>\n<td>v3</td>\n<td>v4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pinia</td>\n<td>v1（兼容）</td>\n<td>v2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Vuetify</td>\n<td>v2</td>\n<td>v3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Element UI</td>\n<td>Element UI</td>\n<td>Element Plus</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ant Design</td>\n<td>ant-design-vue 1/2</td>\n<td>ant-design-vue 3/4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Nuxt</td>\n<td>Nuxt 2</td>\n<td>Nuxt 3</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 迁移前先检查所有第三方依赖是否有 Vue 3 兼容版本。如果关键依赖不兼容，可能需要寻找替代方案或等待更新。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Vue 3 的破坏性变更包括全局 API 实例化、v-model 行为、移除事件总线和过滤器等</li>\n<li><strong>Migration Build</strong>（<code>@vue/compat</code>）支持在 Vue 3 中运行 Vue 2 代码，输出迁移警告</li>\n<li>推荐<strong>渐进式迁移</strong>：环境升级 → 核心 API 迁移 → 现代化改造</li>\n<li><code>.sync</code> 修饰符被 <code>v-model:propName</code> 取代，支持多个 v-model</li>\n<li>EventBus 被移除，推荐使用 mitt 等轻量事件库替代</li>\n<li>迁移前检查第三方依赖的 Vue 3 兼容情况，是规划迁移时间的关键因素</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Vue 2 到 Vue 3 迁移","id":"vue-2-到-vue-3-迁移"},{"level":2,"text":"迁移概述","id":"迁移概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"主要破坏性变更","id":"主要破坏性变更"},{"level":3,"text":"全局 API 变化","id":"全局-api-变化"},{"level":3,"text":"模板语法变化","id":"模板语法变化"},{"level":2,"text":"移除的特性","id":"移除的特性"},{"level":2,"text":"Migration Build","id":"migration-build"},{"level":2,"text":"渐进式迁移策略","id":"渐进式迁移策略"},{"level":3,"text":"第一阶段：环境升级","id":"第一阶段-环境升级"},{"level":3,"text":"第二阶段：核心迁移","id":"第二阶段-核心迁移"},{"level":3,"text":"第三阶段：现代化","id":"第三阶段-现代化"},{"level":2,"text":"生态兼容性","id":"生态兼容性"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Vue 组件测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/vue-in-depth/ecosystem-and-patterns/testing-vue-components"},"next":{"title":"性能优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/vue-in-depth/ecosystem-and-patterns/performance-optimization"}}